[{:db/id "q-8079/selection/b155795afe7d156b84cc790f46ee4f9db4733577cddc555b400a02e196987433" :answer/id #uuid "2e52a703-3688-5feb-9014-4b2a260e5a06" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "z=2\\,{\\text{e}}^{5\\pi \\text{i}/3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-8079/selection/7619d0486f4bd29bb0fc97b62a4743e0d5fcf9674adefa36d12f0962a4396a7f" :answer/id #uuid "2e7c41b7-1dc1-5c34-9e4e-933e5b3be622" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "z=4\\,{\\text{e}}^{5\\pi \\text{i}/3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-8079/selection/0020e9c1807ab454cc86a7bfb12d6b73c0b6d57bc4d1ac0622c0991bad4021cf" :answer/id #uuid "a238e508-9d15-5832-b53e-947a4e50073d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "z=2\\,{\\text{e}}^{4\\pi \\text{i}/3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-8079/selection/94820436926bea79ec6e3c1d8f7a29e49b2a97de649615501abe5e3940bc7599" :answer/id #uuid "2f71b7b8-7466-52bf-b9fd-cf845143c794" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "z=4\\,{\\text{e}}^{5\\pi \\text{i}/6}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-8079/selection/688e0f503835445066d1de6d51ef8528c067bfad6f88d2cda3908a5b525bcfac" :answer/id #uuid "0d33b851-6ffa-5aec-8c8b-e53bd46e586a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "z=2\\,{\\text{e}}^{5\\pi \\text{i}/6}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-8079/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "a9651cee-cfac-5a7f-beb7-821a6a9f1e80" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-8079/selection/b155795afe7d156b84cc790f46ee4f9db4733577cddc555b400a02e196987433" :answer-field/choices ["q-8079/selection/b155795afe7d156b84cc790f46ee4f9db4733577cddc555b400a02e196987433" "q-8079/selection/7619d0486f4bd29bb0fc97b62a4743e0d5fcf9674adefa36d12f0962a4396a7f" "q-8079/selection/0020e9c1807ab454cc86a7bfb12d6b73c0b6d57bc4d1ac0622c0991bad4021cf" "q-8079/selection/94820436926bea79ec6e3c1d8f7a29e49b2a97de649615501abe5e3940bc7599" "q-8079/selection/688e0f503835445066d1de6d51ef8528c067bfad6f88d2cda3908a5b525bcfac"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-8079" :question/id #uuid "389cf7b9-2b41-57c8-80f6-0da73021dc80" :question/math-academy-id "q-8079" :question/problem "Write the complex number $z=1-\\text{i}\\sqrt{3}$ in exponential form." :question/worked-solution "To write our complex number in the form $z=r{\\text{e}}^{\\text{i}\\theta },$ where $r=|z|$ and $\\theta =\\operatorname{arg}⁡(z),$ we first calculate $r:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}r=|z| & =\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{{1}^{2}+(-\\sqrt{3})^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{4}=2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, since $z$ lies in the fourth quadrant, we can find the angle $\\theta $ as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\theta =\\operatorname{arg}⁡(z) & =2\\pi -|\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(\\frac{y}{x})| \\\\  & =2\\pi -|\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(-\\sqrt{3})| \\\\  & =2\\pi -\\frac{\\pi }{3} \\\\  & =\\frac{5\\pi }{3}\\,.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, substituting $r=2$ and $\\theta =\\frac{5\\pi }{3}$ into $z=r{e}^{\\text{i}\\theta },$ we get\n\n$$\nz=2\\,{\\text{e}}^{5\\pi \\text{i}/3}.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-8079/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "01caf021-de3e-5e2a-89ce-ba289b65c0ff"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-8079"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-8083/selection/f3c9f9609636cae25a5c74be1db4828e83d1e42f224d21230f392a41a012eb36" :answer/id #uuid "6e8a88c7-1663-5d9a-b467-98dae17d77ec" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "z=\\sqrt{13}\\,{\\text{e}}^{5\\pi \\text{i}/6}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-8083/selection/b7d0279751d4f571edc943dd5495ee029fb9c7f90696bb6595f12277ed29ee3b" :answer/id #uuid "3b6e3183-a89b-501c-8369-4e91fb88c6a9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "z=\\sqrt{17}\\,{\\text{e}}^{2.897\\,\\text{i}}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-8083/selection/9eaf8b9dc142d289f198a8baa9a42b67b701f14e1d7978f0a5aec325ddfe8cb5" :answer/id #uuid "f8abc44d-ee07-51c8-9c53-d20b91d260ea" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "z=\\sqrt{5}\\,{\\text{e}}^{0.245\\,\\text{i}}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-8083/selection/0fcaf866a2ded21e3a76f05e83b8a801d413bb9b2279a3a924d693ac2575c652" :answer/id #uuid "47d76815-e545-5a1f-9d74-b0e8cecf03a2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "z=\\sqrt{5}\\,{\\text{e}}^{2.897\\,\\text{i}}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-8083/selection/a556821351b39786ae6a2463a646af8c2899e41f4e8ecc00eba3012416267074" :answer/id #uuid "99526b05-742a-5fbd-8bee-3357e41f8e69" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "z=\\sqrt{17}\\,{\\text{e}}^{0.245\\,\\text{i}}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-8083/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "60730ae9-03c9-5d8b-b308-95618926d721" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-8083/selection/b7d0279751d4f571edc943dd5495ee029fb9c7f90696bb6595f12277ed29ee3b" :answer-field/choices ["q-8083/selection/f3c9f9609636cae25a5c74be1db4828e83d1e42f224d21230f392a41a012eb36" "q-8083/selection/b7d0279751d4f571edc943dd5495ee029fb9c7f90696bb6595f12277ed29ee3b" "q-8083/selection/9eaf8b9dc142d289f198a8baa9a42b67b701f14e1d7978f0a5aec325ddfe8cb5" "q-8083/selection/0fcaf866a2ded21e3a76f05e83b8a801d413bb9b2279a3a924d693ac2575c652" "q-8083/selection/a556821351b39786ae6a2463a646af8c2899e41f4e8ecc00eba3012416267074"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-8083" :question/id #uuid "6442ed14-04ef-564f-83f4-3a6e00a9f925" :question/math-academy-id "q-8083" :question/problem "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14059847/assets/83c490278bec718da1338f8926e9d67d2f72909487b9a85bbd386cbf72def2bb.png)\n\nWrite the complex number $z$, shown on the Argand diagram above, in the form $r{e}^{\\text{i}\\theta },$ giving $\\theta $ in radians to $3$ decimal places." :question/worked-solution "The complex number shown in the Argand diagram can be written as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}z & =x+\\text{i}y \\\\  & =-4+\\text{i}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTo write it in the form $z=r{\\text{e}}^{\\text{i}\\theta },$ where $r=|z|$ and $\\theta =\\operatorname{arg}⁡(z),$ we first calculate $r:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}r=|z| & =\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{(-4)^{2}+{1}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{17}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince $z$ lies in the second quadrant of the complex plane, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\theta =\\operatorname{arg}⁡(z) & =\\pi -|\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(\\frac{y}{x})| \\\\  & =\\pi -|\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(-\\frac{1}{4})| \\\\  & ≈2.897.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, substituting $r=\\sqrt{17}$ and $\\theta =2.897$ into $z=r{e}^{\\text{i}\\theta },$ we get\n\n$$\nz=\\sqrt{17}\\,{\\text{e}}^{2.897\\,\\text{i}}.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-8083/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "9be02ade-3dd2-5ec3-a532-78d1151dc89f"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-8083"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-17519/selection/7d4ac09b9f9daf1d55244c90468a830dffc4b68192d8cc837107c100dd3442bc" :answer/id #uuid "58dfb56d-151a-532b-8c17-cf232edca91f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "z=2\\sqrt{2}\\,{\\text{e}}^{3.434\\text{i}}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-17519/selection/eba3ba5f305564546b75f636822e3b6fa784580f3826e0d8075191e153d571b5" :answer/id #uuid "32bed052-5197-5377-ab64-ca0154770811" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "z=5\\,{\\text{e}}^{3.927\\text{i}}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-17519/selection/a99fc0d1a85f65b77ae7e1650b230613ccb14852053c784d59a8d6b5ec5fd7b3" :answer/id #uuid "e9aa5602-f788-5169-8420-a93fecc21a78" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "z=2\\sqrt{2}\\,{\\text{e}}^{3.927\\text{i}}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-17519/selection/08dd1e4eff4b855bd63c255fff5281d4de39b20d8c685d3a58002e6b3cba0dc1" :answer/id #uuid "b838ae03-